Short:        Unbounded priority queue implementation
Author:       vince@locebbs.chnet.ch (Vincenzo Annaloro)
Uploader:     vince locebbs chnet ch (Vincenzo Annaloro)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

This is a specification and an implementation
of a priority queue data structure using a linked
implementation. 
It includes:
- pqueue.h : specification of the priority queue
- pqueue.c : implementaton of the priority queue
